	(text "MQ7 module - AO to ADC1_IN1 (PA0) through R6/R7 (5 V max -> 3.2 V)\nModule VCC is the switched heater rail (5.0 V / 1.4 V) from the\nhardware/mq7_heater_switch board on J1, controlled by PC0 (MQ7_HEATER)\nJ1: 1 +5V, 2 GND, 3 MQ7_HEATER, 4 MQ7_VCC - check pin order against that board"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 215.9 0)
		(effects
